1
00:02:00,396 --> 00:02:02,396


2
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:19,088
His Majesty, the King of Faiango, has arrived!

3
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:24,454
All those kings look so grand.

4
00:02:24,590 --> 00:02:27,702
Well, it's the hunting competition hosted by Princess Sapphire today.

5
00:02:27,727 --> 00:02:29,458
Quite a prize!

6
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,140
I heard it's made entirely of gold.

7
00:02:31,796 --> 00:02:33,788
Incredible, golden armor!

8
00:02:34,125 --> 00:02:37,180
So whoever catches the most game gets to keep it.

9
00:02:38,584 --> 00:02:42,587
The King of Polgarland!

10
00:02:44,964 --> 00:02:48,082
Lord Drollery has arrived!

11
00:02:48,542 --> 00:02:52,265
The Buan brothers of the Kingdom of Buan...

12
00:02:52,296 --> 00:02:56,163
and the Grand Duke of the Kingdom of Orgarland!

13
00:02:56,923 --> 00:03:02,584
Next, Prince Franz of Goldland!

14
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:06,437
Oh! Hey! He looks like such a kind and strong prince!

15
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:13,389
The Grand Duke of the Kingdom of Bosunaria!

16
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,520
Maybe this one.

17
00:03:21,544 --> 00:03:24,677
Or a brighter color? I like this shape.

18
00:03:24,701 --> 00:03:25,255


19
00:03:25,279 --> 00:03:26,372
White is nice too.

20
00:03:26,684 --> 00:03:29,320
She's been at it for an hour already.

21
00:03:42,610 --> 00:03:45,920
Today's hunt is going to be quite the grand event, Grand Duke.

22
00:03:49,366 --> 00:03:50,980
Grand Duke Duralumin, isn't it?

23
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:57,559
I come from the X-Union.

24
00:03:57,583 --> 00:03:59,780
I have a favor to ask of you.

25
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:05,040
This is a gift from X-Union. Please accept it.

26
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,020
And what do you want me to do?

27
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:11,078
It's simple, Prince Franz.

28
00:04:18,561 --> 00:04:19,948
Is Princess Sapphire here yet?

29
00:04:20,485 --> 00:04:22,300
She is currently changing.

30
00:04:25,605 --> 00:04:28,270
I'll go with this one after all. Oh, hello, Franz!

31
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,365
Welcome, Franz.

32
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,980
Welcome, Prince Franz.

33
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:37,023
Just kidding. Doesn't look like Prince Franz after all.

34
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:40,189
How dare you trick me!

35
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:47,784
Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry! It was just a joke! Wait, Tink!

36
00:04:50,587 --> 00:04:51,587
Princess Sapphire!

37
00:04:52,665 --> 00:04:53,970
Franz!

38
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,680
Are you alright?

39
00:04:55,798 --> 00:04:56,264
Yes.

40
00:04:56,455 --> 00:04:57,829
Thank you so much for inviting me today.

41
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:18,120
Okay! Let's start!

42
00:05:34,224 --> 00:05:36,224
Giddy-up!

43
00:05:36,514 --> 00:05:38,147
Yahoo!

44
00:05:41,358 --> 00:05:43,381
Giddy-up!

45
00:05:52,694 --> 00:05:54,893
Well, if it isn't Prince Franz!

46
00:05:55,547 --> 00:05:57,275
Ah, the more I look at it, the finer a horse it is.

47
00:05:57,300 --> 00:06:03,600
However, I hear Goldland horses look impressive, but can't run at all.

48
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,607
No way, that can't be true.

49
00:06:08,194 --> 00:06:10,860
Then how about a race to the swamp?

50
00:06:12,650 --> 00:06:13,412
Alright, let's do it!

51
00:06:14,397 --> 00:06:15,420
Franz!

52
00:06:15,444 --> 00:06:17,060
Don't worry, we definitely won't lose!

53
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:18,840
Let's go, Lord Nylon!

54
00:06:29,022 --> 00:06:30,119
That went well.

55
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:32,314
Now it's your turn!

56
00:06:33,406 --> 00:06:34,125
Go!

57
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:42,100
Yahoo!

58
00:06:46,358 --> 00:06:47,155
Ouch!

59
00:06:51,451 --> 00:06:52,860
What a huge place.

60
00:06:59,135 --> 00:07:00,740
Prince Franz and Nylon.

61
00:07:01,287 --> 00:07:02,340
Where are they going?

62
00:07:02,875 --> 00:07:04,300
Alright, let me follow them.

63
00:07:05,576 --> 00:07:07,287
Get me closer!

64
00:07:13,230 --> 00:07:14,428
Taking the right path. Yah!

65
00:07:19,075 --> 00:07:22,980
Too bad for you. That's a graveyard. You fell right into our trap.

66
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:40,435
Look, the black hawk is here. It's the signal.

67
00:07:40,459 --> 00:07:41,780
Go inform Madame Gagol.

68
00:07:41,925 --> 00:07:42,386
Got it.

69
00:07:48,090 --> 00:07:49,154
Come in.

70
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:51,820
What is it?

71
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:53,240
The signal hawk has arrived.

72
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,320
I see. It's here.

73
00:07:59,385 --> 00:08:01,201
Foolish brat.

74
00:08:01,225 --> 00:08:03,140
Poor Franz.

75
00:08:03,490 --> 00:08:05,820
Pitiful Goldland.

76
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,620
There's the signal! Begin!

77
00:08:18,690 --> 00:08:20,944
Slaves! Get to work!

78
00:08:45,289 --> 00:08:48,400
How odd, there's no swamp here. Isn't this a graveyard?

79
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:48,520
And that's how it's done. I am the greatest hunter in the world.

80
00:09:48,590 --> 00:09:52,980
No, no, you're not the world's best hunter. I am!

81
00:09:55,055 --> 00:09:58,620
No, I am! I caught thirty of them!

82
00:10:00,979 --> 00:10:03,480
It's me! I caught a bear this huge!

83
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,960
It's me!

84
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:07,620
Me!

85
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:09,920
I wonder what happened to Franz?

86
00:10:10,340 --> 00:10:11,340
Lord Sapphire!

87
00:10:13,079 --> 00:10:14,877
Lord Sapphire, I have returned.

88
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:16,242
And Franz?

89
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:22,269
That clumsy prince lost the horse race to me and ran back crying to Goldland.

90
00:10:22,545 --> 00:10:26,361
That Franz is truly all show and no spine.

91
00:10:30,782 --> 00:10:31,782
No way...

92
00:10:42,809 --> 00:10:45,115
Today's hunt was truly delightful.

93
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,160
Indeed, indeed.

94
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:49,160
Yes, your marksmanship is quite impressive.

95
00:10:49,185 --> 00:10:50,840
No, you were splendid as well.

96
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:52,860
Yes, it really was wonderful.

97
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:55,404
Still, we can't just keep enjoying ourselves forever.

98
00:10:55,428 --> 00:10:56,039
Hm?

99
00:10:56,250 --> 00:10:59,204
General! Are you aware of X-Union?

100
00:11:00,820 --> 00:11:01,920
I have seen it with my own eyes.

101
00:11:02,459 --> 00:11:07,660
It was truly dreadful. Before long, they will surely reach our lands as well.

102
00:11:10,035 --> 00:11:12,951
One day, every single tree and blade of grass

103
00:11:12,975 --> 00:11:15,185
across the country withered away.

104
00:11:16,248 --> 00:11:19,340
With no plants left, the people starved.

105
00:11:20,032 --> 00:11:22,935
That is when X-Union strikes.

106
00:11:22,967 --> 00:11:26,256
They burn down homes and slaughter people indiscriminately.

107
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:28,040
 It all happens in an instant.

108
00:11:28,619 --> 00:11:30,763
Word is they possess countless deadly weapons

109
00:11:30,787 --> 00:11:33,220
the likes of which we've never seen.

110
00:11:36,077 --> 00:11:39,076
And the food distributed afterward is laced with a drug

111
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:43,756
that strips away the will to fight or think,

112
00:11:43,780 --> 00:11:49,320
leaving people with no spirit to do anything—slaves to X-Union.

113
00:11:51,014 --> 00:11:54,300
That is X-Union: a terrifying organization.

114
00:11:55,526 --> 00:11:56,856
Who on earth could they be?

115
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,334
Speaking of which, the King of Garban,

116
00:11:58,367 --> 00:12:00,768
standing in for my nation, doesn't seem to be in top form today.

117
00:12:01,155 --> 00:12:03,146
Where will they come from first?

118
00:12:04,165 --> 00:12:06,720
That was quite a terrifying maneuver.

119
00:12:26,389 --> 00:12:27,123
Franz,

120
00:12:27,826 --> 00:12:29,620
 I know it's a lie that you ran away.

121
00:12:30,650 --> 00:12:31,240
But...

122
00:12:31,366 --> 00:12:33,020
 where did you go?

123
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,327
Sapphire!

124
00:12:39,702 --> 00:12:40,320
Tink!

125
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:41,959
Prince Franz is in big trouble! 

126
00:12:42,139 --> 00:12:44,802
Over on the other side of the forest where all the graves are,

127
00:12:44,826 --> 00:12:47,419
a creepy old woman took him away!

128
00:12:47,632 --> 00:12:49,135
Tink, lead the way!

129
00:13:19,806 --> 00:13:26,260
Goldland is already as good as in the hands of X-Union.

130
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:29,013
And when this underground empire is complete,

131
00:13:29,483 --> 00:13:32,480
we will crush Silverland with our own hands.

132
00:13:36,819 --> 00:13:38,392
Are you awake?

133
00:13:38,416 --> 00:13:42,360
This time, you will sleep forever...

134
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:45,920
What?

135
00:13:45,970 --> 00:13:47,572
Look above you.

136
00:13:47,596 --> 00:13:52,501
A 50-ton block of iron is hanging there by a single thin rope.

137
00:13:52,526 --> 00:13:57,400
But in a few minutes, that rope is set to snap.

138
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,172
What is this thing?!

139
00:14:34,081 --> 00:14:35,020
I won't give up!

140
00:14:41,948 --> 00:14:42,572
Is it around here? 

141
00:14:44,002 --> 00:14:45,046
Let's go deeper in.

142
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,001
Uh-oh.

143
00:14:55,306 --> 00:14:56,420
This place looks suspicious.

144
00:14:57,150 --> 00:14:57,946
Someone's coming.

145
00:15:03,114 --> 00:15:04,416
I thought I heard voices...

146
00:15:04,666 --> 00:15:05,716
Must be my imagination.

147
00:15:12,654 --> 00:15:13,654
Was that a bit too rough?

148
00:15:19,629 --> 00:15:21,315
Looks like it leads underground...

149
00:15:26,027 --> 00:15:27,404
Oh no! Tink!

150
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,280
Tink!

151
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:36,971
Sapphire!

152
00:15:37,294 --> 00:15:38,723
Tink! Are you okay?

153
00:15:41,369 --> 00:15:43,240
Someone's coming! Run, Sapphire!

154
00:15:44,039 --> 00:15:48,120
Tink, I'm sorry. But if I freeze up now, we're finished.

155
00:15:50,265 --> 00:15:51,221
Who are you?!

156
00:15:52,354 --> 00:15:53,470
What are you doing?!

157
00:15:53,495 --> 00:15:55,870
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

158
00:16:55,379 --> 00:16:56,971
That's what happens when you get soft.

159
00:16:57,644 --> 00:16:59,548
Now, get to work!

160
00:17:01,899 --> 00:17:02,974
How terrible...

161
00:17:03,643 --> 00:17:07,619
I see. So these really are the X-Union guys Fugaaf mentioned.

162
00:17:08,566 --> 00:17:11,558
The people being forced to work are from other countries.

163
00:17:25,389 --> 00:17:27,920
Where on earth are they holding Franz?

164
00:17:28,269 --> 00:17:29,840
Franz, where are you?

165
00:17:43,659 --> 00:17:46,780
Spill it already, pipsqueak!

166
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:50,460
Shut up! I'm Tink, not a pipsqueak!

167
00:17:50,461 --> 00:17:55,520
Whatever. Tell me who came with you. You couldn't have come alone.

168
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,471
I see.

169
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:00,800
Hey, kid. You're the runt who's always following Sapphire around, aren't you?

170
00:18:01,439 --> 00:18:03,880
I'm not following her around! I'm an assistant!

171
00:18:05,759 --> 00:18:09,620
Sapphire? This kills two birds with one stone.

172
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:15,292
Tighten security around France. Kill anyone suspicious on sight.

173
00:18:15,316 --> 00:18:16,660
Got it? Move out!

174
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:17,737
Yes.

175
00:18:18,439 --> 00:18:24,293
How about I teach you a lesson so you can't talk back, pipsqueak?

176
00:18:33,409 --> 00:18:34,323
That young fool.

177
00:18:34,347 --> 00:18:37,540
Showing such courage right after arriving... what a pity.

178
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:39,250
It's Franz!

179
00:18:40,559 --> 00:18:43,000
Hey, you two! The captain's calling you!

180
00:18:43,024 --> 00:18:44,100
Got it!

181
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:47,040
Franz!

182
00:18:47,609 --> 00:18:50,874
Sapphire! Get out of here! This is the X-Union's fortress!

183
00:18:51,599 --> 00:18:53,100
Franz! I came to save you!

184
00:18:53,205 --> 00:18:55,474
No! If you linger, you'll be killed!

185
00:18:55,679 --> 00:18:57,380
Don't worry! Leave it to me!

186
00:18:58,625 --> 00:18:59,625
No!

187
00:18:59,783 --> 00:19:00,783
But...

188
00:19:01,609 --> 00:19:02,866
Get out!

189
00:19:06,259 --> 00:19:10,060
What? You say I called for you? I said no such thing!

190
00:19:10,355 --> 00:19:12,980
Damn it! It's Sapphire! She snuck in with that brat!

191
00:19:12,981 --> 00:19:14,156
Hurry, everyone!

192
00:19:23,282 --> 00:19:26,040
Sapphire... please escape safely.

193
00:19:38,229 --> 00:19:41,640
Don't worry. Franz is tied up tight.

194
00:19:43,859 --> 00:19:48,380
But where did that liar go? That masked X spy!

195
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:49,460
Right! Exactly!

196
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,300
Knight of the Ribbon!

197
00:20:05,109 --> 00:20:06,520
Prince Franz! I've come to help you!

198
00:20:07,159 --> 00:20:08,800
Ribbon Knight? Get him!

199
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:10,960
Watch out!

200
00:20:18,494 --> 00:20:19,588
I don't have time!

201
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,920
Aha, an intruder!

202
00:20:43,314 --> 00:20:45,320
Go! I don't care if you kill them!

203
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:56,660
They're cut!

204
00:21:04,583 --> 00:21:07,174
I'm saved. Thank you, Ribbon Knight.

205
00:21:07,339 --> 00:21:08,480
Tink has been captured.

206
00:21:08,974 --> 00:21:09,986
Right, let's hurry!

207
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:16,000
It's Ribbon Knight!

208
00:21:16,479 --> 00:21:17,989
What, Ribbon Knight?

209
00:21:18,504 --> 00:21:20,800
I see. We can't leave him alive!

210
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:21,757
King Noir!

211
00:21:21,900 --> 00:21:22,920
You were in on this too?

212
00:21:26,299 --> 00:21:30,020
That's right, I am Noir. Head of the Blackland division of X-Union!

213
00:21:31,544 --> 00:21:34,340
Prince Franz! Let me lure them into the central cave!

214
00:21:34,794 --> 00:21:36,060
We'll blast them to pieces!

215
00:21:41,279 --> 00:21:42,740
Pursue them! Don't let them escape!

216
00:21:51,247 --> 00:21:52,816
Everyone who's been enslaved!

217
00:21:55,304 --> 00:21:57,580
Now is the time to defeat X-Union!

218
00:21:58,349 --> 00:21:58,901
That's right!

219
00:21:58,925 --> 00:22:02,260
Everyone, lend Ribbon Knight a hand! We'll strike down X-Union!

220
00:22:08,184 --> 00:22:10,496
Damn those slaves!

221
00:22:11,649 --> 00:22:12,340
Mr. Noir!

222
00:22:12,420 --> 00:22:15,660
I'll leave the rest to you! I have to contact headquarters!

223
00:22:50,776 --> 00:22:52,811
Take one step and you're dead.

224
00:22:54,581 --> 00:22:55,128
Right.

225
00:23:04,277 --> 00:23:05,449
Oh, is it collapsing?

226
00:23:11,526 --> 00:23:14,453
Run! The underground empire is collapsing!

227
00:23:31,151 --> 00:23:34,559
Hey! Get over here! Ribbon, hurry out!

228
00:23:34,708 --> 00:23:35,346
Tink!

229
00:23:35,459 --> 00:23:37,380
Hurry, let's run! Before we get crushed!

230
00:23:38,209 --> 00:23:39,295
Wait up!

231
00:24:06,485 --> 00:24:09,034
Curse that Knight of the Ribbon for getting in my way!

232
00:24:09,409 --> 00:24:11,720
I am just so furious!

233
00:24:12,829 --> 00:24:19,040
Just watch! One day, X-Union will rule Silverland!

234
00:24:30,119 --> 00:24:32,620
The X-Union. So the rumors were true.

235
00:24:33,169 --> 00:24:35,699
Don't worry. If anything happens to this kingdom,

236
00:24:35,724 --> 00:24:37,800
I'll be the first to come protect you.

237
00:24:38,354 --> 00:24:39,354
Thank you, Franz.

238
00:24:40,359 --> 00:24:43,959
We were saved, all thanks to you. Thank you.

239
00:24:45,225 --> 00:24:46,966
Thank you. Thank you.

240
00:24:48,099 --> 00:24:49,602
You're making me blush.

241
00:24:50,516 --> 00:24:52,516

